Subject: [PATCH] fix(f1): restore suppressible title header + update
 first-slice harness to v5 nav (T8)

- AppShell: restore a v5 .pbar title header (T7 went header-less and dropped
  every existing page's heading); add hideHeader so v5 screens opt out.
- verify-first-visible-slice.mjs / route-coverage.mjs: assert the new 5-tab nav
  labels, allow the 4 known-forward tab routes (built U1-U7), add src/lib/ui to
  the first-slice allowlist. Old content + mock-flow assertions unchanged.

Full suite: 159 pass / 0 fail; route coverage passes 15 routes. The pre-revamp
acceptance harness is flagged for a Codex rewrite to the Alerts+Requests model.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
